  "solution": "The pattern followed in the given series is:\n\n**First term × (Third term - 1) = Second term**\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(16, 64, 5)\n\n16 × (__**5 - 1**__) = 64\n\n__**16 **____**× 4**__ = 64\n\n64 = 64\n\nSimilarly,\n\n(9, 27, 4)\n\n9 × (__**4** - 1__) = 27\n\n__9 ____× 3__ = 27\n\n27 = 27\n\nNow we apply the pattern to the given options:\n\nOption 1) (11, 56, 7)\n\n11 × (__7 - 1__) = 56\n\n__11 × 6__ = 56\n\n66 ≠ 56\n\nOption 2) (21, 126, 7)\n\n21 × (__7 - 1__) = 126\n\n__21 ____× 6__ = 126\n\n126 = 126\n\nOption 3) (10, 50, 5)\n\n10 × (__5 - 1__) = 50\n\n__10 × 4__ = 50\n\n40 ≠ 50\n\nOption 4) (13, 91, 10)\n\n13 × (__10 - 1__) = 91\n\n__13 × 9__ = 91\n\n117 ≠ 91\n\nHence the correct answer is **option 2)**",
